  lines:
  - speakerName: You
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: You said you can grant one wish.
  - speakerName: Genie
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: Yes, after you help me.
  - speakerName: You
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: That was not in the contract.
  - speakerName: Genie
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: There is no contract. This is a magical lamp.
  - speakerName: You
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: "So I don\u2019t have a choice?"
  - speakerName: Genie
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: You have choices. You can go up the hill now, or you can go up the hill
      after complaining.
  - speakerName: You
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: Fine..
  options: []
